# Mirrorweave makes Bot1's Llanowar Elves a copy of Ornithopter, a 0/2 flier, in layer 1 (CR 613.1a, 707.2). What else applies
# to the Elves applies to the copy on top, in the later layers (CR 613.1, 613.4; the ruling: "Noncopy effects that have
# already applied to the other creatures will continue to apply to them"): Snakeskin Veil's +1/+1 counter and its hexproof
# until end of turn, and Rancor's +2/+0 and trample, still attached. The copy is a 3/3 artifact Ornithopter with flying,
# hexproof and trample.

